fields.value:
 * {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|lina_slow_burn}}
** Does not proc on {{M|item}} abilities.
** Deals {{Code|ImpactDamage × {{#expr:{{#var:Slow Burn value1}}/{{#var:Slow Burn value2}}}}}} {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} in 1-second intervals, starting 1 second upon debuff application, over {{#var:Slow Burn value2}} ({{Symbol|bonus t4r}} {{ValueColor||{{#var:Slow Burn value2 tal}}|25tal}}) damage instances.
** Increases all abilities' total [[spell damage]] by a {{Code|{{#expr:1+{{#var:Slow Burn value1}}}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t4r}} {{Code|{{ValueColor||{{#expr:1+{{#var:Slow Burn value1 tal}}}}|tal|x}}}}) factor ([[before reductions]]) over the entire duration.
** {{M|Outgoing damage|text=Outgoing}} spell damage amplification sources affects the total spell damage before the damage per second component is calculated.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** {{Symbol|bonus t4l}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|lina_crit_debuff}}
*** Attacks now apply an ensured {{M|critical strike}} proc, upon Lina's {{M|attack point}}, on enemy units affected by Lina's abilities with the debuff applied.
*** Only affects Lina's attacks, does not affect her {{M|Summons|text=player-controlled units}}' attacks.
*** Critical strike sources with lesser values have no effect if they proc as the higher factor takes precedence.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Slow Burn icon0}}
| desc = Lina's abilities deal an additional 64% damage as burn damage over 4s.
}}
* {{cf|talnotes}}
** {{Symbol|bonus t4l}}
*** The {{M|attack point}}-based ensured {{M|critical strike}} source has the following properties:
*** {{Symbol|Ranged}}
**** {{M|Ranged}} heroes attack {{M|projectiles}} do not proc the ensured critical strike if the debuff is applied mid-flight.
**** Vice versa, already launched attacks proc the critical strike even if the debuff expires before the projectile lands.

